      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for ghostscript fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2025-59798: Fixed stack-based buffer overflow in pdf_write_cmap in devices/vector/gdevpdtw.c. (bsc#1250353)\n- CVE-2025-59799: Fixed stack-based buffer overflow in pdfmark_coerce_dest in devices/vector/gdevpdfm.c via a large size value. (bsc#1250354)\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
